OL,3,GNEWSAGrieving families of crash PCs
OL,4,A'helped by kindness'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe families of two police officers
OL,7,Fkilled in a crash have thanked people
OL,8,Ffor their "dignity" and "kindness"
OL,9,Fafter separate funerals were held for
OL,10,Fboth men.
OL,12,FPC Matthew Blades, 37, and PC Tom
OL,13,FClough, 38, died when a Volkswagen
OL,14,FPassat travelling the wrong way crashed
OL,15,Finto their marked armed response car on
OL,16,Fthe A66 at South Bank, near
OL,17,FMiddlesbrough, on 22 August, also
OL,18,Fkilling the five males in the other
OL,19,Fcar.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,392,390,260,160,0,100
PN,39102
